passages.text:
Common names
Afrikaans: {{lang|af|fakkelboom}}, {{lang|af|Afrika-vlamboom}}
Bangla: {{Transliteration|bn|rudrapalash}} ({{lang|bn|রুদ্রপলাশ}})
English: African tulip tree, fountain tree, Nandi flame, Nile flame, squirt tree, tulip tree, Uganda flame, Flame Tree of Thika
Fijian: {{lang|fj|pasiu}}, {{lang|fj|pisipisi}}
French: tulipier de Gabon
Hindi: {{Transliteration|hi|rugtoora}} ({{lang|hi|रुग्तूरा}})
Javanese: {{lang|jv|ꦕꦿꦸꦠ꧀​ꦕꦿꦸꦠꦤ꧀}} crut-crutan
Kannada: {{Transliteration|kn|Neerukayi mara, Jeerkolavi mara}} ({{lang|kn|ನೀರುಕಾಯಿ ಮರ, ಜೀರ್ಕೊೞವಿ ಮರ, ಜೀರ್ಕೊಳವಿ ಮರ }})
Luganda: {{lang|lg|kifabakazi}}
Luhya: {{lang|luy|muzurio}}
Malay: {{lang|ms|panchut-panchut}}
Malayalam: African Poomaram ({{lang|ml|ആഫ്രിക്കൻ പൂമരം}})
Sinhala: {{Transliteration|si|kudaella gaha}}, {{Transliteration|si|kudulu}} 
Spanish: {{lang|es|amapola}}, {{lang|es|espatodea}}, {{lang|es|mampolo}}, {{lang|es|tulipán africano}}, in Puerto Rico {{lang|es|meaíto}}, in Guatemala {{lang|es|llama del bosque}}.
Sundanese: {{lang|su|ᮊᮄ ᮃᮎᮢᮦᮒ᮪}} kaï acret or {{lang|su|ᮊᮤᮃᮎᮢᮦᮒ᮪}} kiacret
Swahili: {{lang|sw|kibobakasi}}, {{lang|sw|kifabakazi}}
Telugu: {{Transliteration|te|Neeti Budda}} ({{lang|te|నీటి బుడ్డ}}), {{Transliteration|te|Gonuganta}} ({{lang|te|గోనుగంట}})
Tamil: {{Transliteration|ta|pasadi}} ({{lang|ta|பாசடி}})
Nandi: Septet (singular),Septonok (plural) 
Trade name: Nandi flame

